<view class="workspace"><view class="workspace-head admin-head"><view class="head-row"><view><text class="head-title">系统管理</text><text class="head-sub">{{user.nickName}} · {{user.department}}</text></view><view class="logout-link" bindtap="logout">退出</view></view></view><view class="stat-grid"><view class="stat-card"><text class="stat-value admin-value">{{stats.semesters}}</text><text class="stat-label">学期</text></view><view class="stat-card"><text class="stat-value admin-value">{{stats.students}}</text><text class="stat-label">学生</text></view><view class="stat-card"><text class="stat-value admin-value">{{stats.tasks}}</text><text class="stat-label">测评任务</text></view><view class="stat-card"><text class="stat-value risk-watch">{{stats.pendingContent}}</text><text class="stat-label">待审内容</text></view></view><view class="action-grid"><view class="action-item" style="background:#f2eef8;color:#655b7b;" bindtap="goData">学期、人员与导入</view><view class="action-item" style="background:#edf1f7;color:#596e91;" bindtap="goTasks">问卷与测评任务</view><view class="action-item" style="background:#f2eef8;color:#655b7b;" bindtap="goContent">内容审核与发布</view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">最近审计记录</text></view><view class="panel" wx:for="{{logs}}" wx:key="id"><text class="card-title">{{item.action}}</text><view class="card-meta"><text>{{item.operator}}</text><text>{{item.time}}</text></view></view></view><view class="notice">管理员默认不拥有查看全部心理测评原始回答的权限；运维管理和心理业务授权相互分离。</view></view>
